Phase 882: Plant Biology Domain Admin Modules - 3 new WASM application modules:

1. modules/gymnocarpus_admin/src/main.c (Gymnocarpus Wild Potato Administration)
   - Base ID: 2072
   - Manages gymnocarpus (wild potato family) plant research and conservation
   - Features: specimen catalog (16 entries), habitat tracking (grassland/woodland/wetland), tuber morphology records, phenology monitoring (germination/flowering/fruiting/dormancy), seed bank inventory, herbarium voucher tracking, ethnobotanical uses database, conservation status (IUCN)
   - Domain structs: gym_t (id, species, habitat, phenology_stage, tuber_count, seed_viability, voucher_id, cons_status, collection_date, active)
   - Functions: gym_init, gym_specimen_register, gym_habitat_survey, gym_phenology_observe, gym_seed_bank, gym_voucher_catalog
   - Exports: main (demo: specimen registration, habitat survey, phenology tracking, seed banking, voucher catalog)
   - Pattern: follow modules/abelia_admin/src/main.c style

2. modules/gyrostachys_admin/src/main.c (Gyrostachys Orchid Research Administration)
   - Base ID: 2073
   - Manages gyrostachys (orchid genus) research cultivation and taxonomy
   - Features: taxonomic records (16 taxa), propagation protocols (flask/deflasked/potted), in-vitro culture tracking (media composition, subculture cycles), mycorrhizal symbiosis monitoring, pollination records (hand-pollination success rate), chromosome counting, DNA barcode registry, greenhouse climate logging
   - Domain structs: gyro_t (id, taxon, prop_stage, culture_week, media_type, myco_colonized, poll_success, chrom_count, barcode_id, active)
   - Functions: gyro_init, gyro_taxon_register, gyro_propagate, gyro_culture_monitor, gyro_mycorrhiza_check, gyro_pollinate, gyro_barcode
   - Exports: main (demo: taxon registration, propagation pipeline, culture monitoring, mycorrhiza inoculation, pollination trials, DNA barcoding)
   - Pattern: follow modules/abelia_admin/src/main.c style

3. modules/hedysarum_admin/src/main.c (Hedysarum Sweetvetch Administration)
   - Base ID: 2074
   - Manages hedysarum (sweetvetch) forage and medicinal herb production
   - Features: field plot management (16 plots), nitrogen fixation monitoring, forage yield trials, root harvest records, swainsonine alkaloid testing (toxic vs non-toxic strains), livestock feed formulation, seed production, soil amendment tracking, drought tolerance scoring
   - Domain structs: hed_t (id, plot, strain, growth_day, n_fix_ppm, forage_kg, root_kg, swainsonine_ppm, seed_kg, drought_score, active)
   - Functions: hed_init, hed_plot_establish, hed_nitrogen_monitor, hed_forage_harvest, hed_root_process, hed_toxin_screen, hed_seed_collect
   - Exports: main (demo: plot establishment, N-fixation monitoring, forage harvest, root processing, toxin screening, seed collection)
   - Pattern: follow modules/abelia_admin/src/main.c style

Build all 3 modules with:
  clang --target=wasm32-unknown-unknown -Oz -nostdlib -fno-builtin -Wl,--no-entry -Wl,--export=main -o modules/<name>/<name>.wasm modules/<name>/src/main.c

